<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Cold-Blooded</ansi> mutation

Your metabolism slows and steadies. Endurance improves as your body
conserves energy, but your mental resilience dulls with it.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Uncommon

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Slightly faster stamina recovery — your efficient metabolism
  replenishes endurance more readily

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Moderately reduced willpower — the metabolic slowdown dulls your
  mental edge

